---
# Lightweight lint gate (learning-roadmap item #13: "keep minimal").
# profile:min enforces only the "does it parse / load / run" tier, which keeps
# the gate stable across ansible-lint releases instead of tracking the tool's
# ever-stricter default profile. Raising to profile:basic (task names, role-name
# convention, yaml formatting) is deferred to a dedicated hardening session —
# tracked in CLAUDE.md "Known Technical Debt".
profile: min
